                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "(duplicating discussion so it doesn't get lost), I'm not interested in this, given the prefixes only mean manufacturer names, and it's rare that one manufacturer actually manufactures all components, and also implies that we're going to start segmenting configs.  If you want to segment configs, that's what the meta layers are for, feel free to get your meta layer maintainer to agree to maintain them.  If you want to check in to EM, where I have to maintain it, I cannot test everyones system and every config, so we need some confidence that bad testing configs are caught by everyone, not just isolated."
                },
